# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outSaturating is project
outSaturating purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outSaturating target console
outSaturating version "0.1.0"
outSaturating language refined 1
outSaturating standardLibrary 1
outSaturating allows write console.stdout none
outSaturating requires none
outSaturating includesModule outSaturating
outSaturating entry outSaturating.main
